Q: How to put many different mysqli_query into the same array with a for loop A: <p>I could solve it.</p>
<p>I had to start $i in the second for loop with 0 AND the condition had to be changed to $i &lt; $number[0] as the first index of the referenced $sql_command[] is 0.</p>
<p>That was the problem.
The correct code is:</p>
<pre><code>for ( $i = 0; $i &lt; $number[0]; $i++ )
{
    $php_to_db_second_comm[] = mysqli_query($sql_conn,$sql_command[$i]) or die(print(&quot;Unsuccess &quot;.mysqli_error()));
}
</code></pre>

Q: Restart animation in CSS3: any better way than removing the element? A: <p>If you have a class for CSS3 animation, for example <em>.blink</em>, then you can <strong>removeClass</strong> for some element and <strong>addClass</strong> for this element thought <em><strong>setTimeout</strong></em> with 1 millisecond by click.</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>$(&quot;#element&quot;).click(function(){
   $(this).removeClass(&quot;blink&quot;);

   setTimeout(function(){
     $(this).addClass(&quot;blink&quot;);
  },1 // it may be only 1 millisecond, but it's enough
});
</code></pre>

Q: How to remove or hide this &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; when resize the browser? A: <p>There are two ways to do your task using JS:</p>
<ol>
<li>resize the browser</li>
<li>using CSS</li>
</ol>
<p>The following demonstrates both, although in my opinion CSS is the better option:</p>
<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-js lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>$(window).resize(function() {
  var winW = $(window).width();
  if (winW &lt;= 991) {
    $('.cart span').hide();
  } else {
    $('.cart span').show();
  }
});</code></pre>
<pre class="snippet-code-css lang-css prettyprint-override"><code>@media (max-width:991px) {
  .cart span {
    display: none
  }
}</code></pre>
<pre class="snippet-code-html lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.7.1/jquery.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;

&lt;p class="cart"&gt;
  &lt;i class="fa fa-cart"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cart&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-1.10.2.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>
